{"id":"f2803e07105244cf","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run.md","title":"ZFC Comp Computation Run","display":"df-zfc-comp-computation-run — ZFC Comp Computation Run","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-computation-run — ZFC Comp Computation Run","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-computation-run — ZFC Comp Computation Run"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,x,r\\in V\">\\(M,x,r\\in V\\)</span> (Turing-machine code, finite input word, and candidate run)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\">\\(M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\)</span> (machine components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M\">\\(\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M\\)</span> (natural-to-integer embedding, word set, finite-support tapes, configurations, initial-configuration graph, and total step graph constructed below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_S\\)</span> (Turing-machine predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computation\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S(r,M,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},\n\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\iota=\\{\\langle m,[\\langle m,0\\rangle]_{\\mathbb Z}\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\omega,\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land W_\\Sigma=\n\\{w\\in V:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma=\n\\Bigl\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\})\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C_M=Q\\times\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma\\times\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land i_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle w,\\langle q_0,T,\\iota(0)\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_\\Sigma\\times C_M:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;T(\\iota(j))=w(j)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\iota[n]\\;T(k)=0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i_M,W_\\Sigma,C_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land S_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\langle q,T,h\\rangle,\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\n\\in C_M\\times C_M:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\n\\bigl(q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle=\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\lor\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\delta(\\langle q,T(h)\\rangle)=\\langle q&#39;,a,d\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land h&#39;=h+d\n\\land T&#39;(h)=a\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}\\;T&#39;(k)=T(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_M,C_M,C_M)\n\\land x\\in W_\\Sigma\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,\\omega,C_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land r(0)=i_M(x)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;r(n+1)=S_M(r(n))\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computation\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S(r,M,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},\n\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\iota=\\{\\langle m,[\\langle m,0\\rangle]_{\\mathbb Z}\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\omega,\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land W_\\Sigma=\n\\{w\\in V:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma=\n\\Bigl\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\})\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C_M=Q\\times\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma\\times\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land i_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle w,\\langle q_0,T,\\iota(0)\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_\\Sigma\\times C_M:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;T(\\iota(j))=w(j)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\iota[n]\\;T(k)=0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i_M,W_\\Sigma,C_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land S_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\langle q,T,h\\rangle,\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle\\rangle\n\\in C_M\\times C_M:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\n\\bigl(q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle=\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\lor\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\delta(\\langle q,T(h)\\rangle)=\\langle q&#39;,a,d\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\land h&#39;=h+d\n\\land T&#39;(h)=a\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}\\;T&#39;(k)=T(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_M,C_M,C_M)\n\\land x\\in W_\\Sigma\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,\\omega,C_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land r(0)=i_M(x)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;r(n+1)=S_M(r(n))\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Configurations are explicit triples of a state, a finite-support two-way tape, and an integer head position; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> places the finite input on the nonnegative tape cells.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_M\">\\(S_M\\)</span> agrees with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> off the two halting states and fixes halting configurations, making every run an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence without an unexplained induced step operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_S$ (Turing-machine predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]] and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]] and [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,x,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computation\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S(r,M,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},\n\\iota,W_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma,C_M,i_M,S_M\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\\\\\n&\\quad M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\iota=\\{\\langle m,[\\langle m,0\\rangle]_{\\mathbb Z}\\rangle:m\\in\\omega\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\omega,\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land W_\\Sigma=\n\\{w\\in V:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma=\n\\Bigl\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:T(k)\\neq0\\})\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land C_M=Q\\times\\mathrm{Tape}_\\Gamma\\times\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&\\quad\\land i_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle w,\\langle q_0,T,\\iota(0)\\rangle\\rangle\\in W_\\Sigma\\times C_M:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;T(\\iota(j))=w(j)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\iota[n]\\;T(k)=0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i_M,W_\\Sigma,C_M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land S_M=\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\langle q,T,h\\rangle,\\langle q',T',h'\\rangle\\rangle\n\\in C_M\\times C_M:\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\n\\bigl(q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\langle q',T',h'\\rangle=\\langle q,T,h\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\lor\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\delta(\\langle q,T(h)\\rangle)=\\langle q',a,d\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{54mm}\\land h'=h+d\n\\land T'(h)=a\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}\\;T'(k)=T(k)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_M,C_M,C_M)\n\\land x\\in W_\\Sigma\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,\\omega,C_M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land r(0)=i_M(x)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;r(n+1)=S_M(r(n))\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"S_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3401,"backlinks":[{"id":"506be2cdd56dc40d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S$ (computation-run predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1752","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run.md|58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb","d9a25b0ac94a3598","244943f88396309f","af73296236e5df83"]}